# The Return of the Adventurer (bastok 30): Gwill in Bastok Markets. The guard (Father Figure completed and Bastok fame
# level 3), the cinnamon trade, the Cotton Headband reward, no repeat. Gwill's default is 113; The Cold Light of Day (also
# on Gwill) stays available here, so it plays nothing.
lists BastokMarkets/Gwill/onTrigger BastokMarkets/Gwill/onTrade BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/242 BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/243
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-317.8,-15.948,-176.4
fame Bastok 125
item StickOfCinnamon x3
item BoneChip
login
trade Gwill StickOfCinnamon x1  # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger Gwill                   # fame level 3, Father Figure not completed: his default 113
finish
quest Bastok.FatherFigure completed
fame Bastok 124
trigger Gwill                   # Father Figure completed, fame 124 (level 2): 113
finish
fame Bastok 125
trigger Gwill                   # the offer, 242
finish                          # accepted
trigger Gwill                   # accepted: no trigger in section 2, his default 113
finish
trade Gwill BoneChip x1         # the wrong item: nothing
trade Gwill StickOfCinnamon x1  # 243
finish                          # completed: Cotton Headband, fame +30, Kulatz Bridge Companion, one cinnamon gone
trigger Gwill                   # completed: 113
finish
trade Gwill StickOfCinnamon x1  # completed: nothing
